The easiest is to use the (Cp based ?) test provided by

   g1 <- gam(y ~ s(x), ...., df = df1)
   g2 <- gam(y ~ s(x), ...., df = df2)

   anova(g1,g2)

Of course, it can be discussed how exactly the nonparametric
degrees of freedom should be counted, and related questions..

