(61.4074/1)/(698.5582/8)=0.703

but in fact, it should be:

(SS(pa)/df(pa))/(SS(pa:su)/df(pa:su))=(61.561/1)/(698.624/9)=0.793

note: the difference in the Sum of Sq is probably just a rounding error.

Thank you for your help.

