Hi all,

The answer is

----------------------
From: "Angelo Canty" <canty at masg40.epfl.ch>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 1998 14:11:26 -0600
The help.start function takes a vector argument of strings used to modify
the look of the window.  The actual form of these arguments will be
dependent on the windows system you are using but the following should
work for what you want.
 help.start("-bg white")

To also change the lettering to (say) blue use
 help.start(c("-bg white","-fg blue"))
