Here is a one-liner that should do what you want fairly efficiently:

> a <- rnorm(20)
> b <- rnorm(10)
> apply(matrix(a), 1, function(x) prod(pnorm(x+x*b)))
 [1] 9.983299e-05 1.588974e-02 2.210214e-03 1.935949e-01 6.538284e-02
